---
source: crates/m2-server-core/tests/friends.rs
expression: h.log
---
-- Alice asks Bob, and Bob asks Alice before answering: they are friends
@1000 conn#2 sends AskFriend Bob
   -> send conn#4 FriendAsked Alice
   -> send conn#2 FriendNotice Bob notice=1
@1000 conn#4 sends AskFriend Alice
   -> store #9: make #2 and #1 friends
   -> send conn#4 FriendChanged Alice status=2
   -> send conn#2 FriendChanged Bob status=2
   -> event: characters 2 and 1 became friends
@1000 store answers #9: friendship written: Ok(())
-- asking a friend again: friends already
@1000 conn#2 sends AskFriend Bob
   -> send conn#2 FriendNotice Bob notice=3
